1
00:00:06,589 --> 00:00:09,092
<i>Welcome to </i>Beauty Revolution!

2
00:00:09,175 --> 00:00:12,429
- Mommy! The show is just starting. Come!
- Coming!

3
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:13,722
<i>…</i>Beauty Revolution.

4
00:00:13,805 --> 00:00:16,683
<i>A leader in this country's</i>
<i>cosmetic surgery industry,</i>

5
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:19,978
<i>and a renowned surgeon,</i>
<i>referred to by all as "The Hand of God,"</i>

6
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:23,481
<i>please welcome the director</i>
<i>of Tohyama Cosmetic Surgery Clinic,</i>

7
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:25,358
<i>Dr. Arata Tohyama!</i>

8
00:00:29,237 --> 00:00:31,906
<i>- Thank you for being here.</i>
- Mommy! Look, it's Daddy!

9
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:32,824
Yes!

10
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:36,828
<i>Everyone, since this is</i>
<i>the very first episode of our show,</i>

11
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:39,873
<i>we'd like to tell you</i>
<i>a bit more about Dr. Tohyama.</i>

12
00:00:40,582 --> 00:00:43,043
Now, just take a look at this.

13
00:00:43,126 --> 00:00:44,919
BEFORE

14
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:50,258
Ladies and gentlemen, do any of you
recognize the person in this picture?

15
00:00:51,051 --> 00:00:52,302
Well, believe it or not,

16
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:55,305
this is actually a picture
of Dr. Tohyama himself.

17
00:00:56,014 --> 00:00:57,390
- What?
- No?!

18
00:00:57,891 --> 00:01:00,810
- <i>So, that's really your face?</i>
- <i>Yes.</i>

19
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:04,022
I performed the surgery on myself,

20
00:01:04,105 --> 00:01:05,690
with the help of The Hand of God.

21
00:01:05,774 --> 00:01:07,692
- <i>Yes, that's right.</i>
- <i>Wow!</i>

22
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:09,819
Isn't that just incredible?

23
00:01:09,903 --> 00:01:12,155
- <i>I would never have guessed.</i>
- Is that true?

24
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:15,492
<i>Just incredible!</i>

25
00:01:15,575 --> 00:01:17,452
I'm still having trouble believing it!

26
00:01:17,535 --> 00:01:18,495
Really amazing.

27
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:38,139
DAD

28
00:01:40,141 --> 00:01:42,727
Mm… What's happening?

29
00:01:43,561 --> 00:01:45,355
Oh, sorry.

30
00:01:46,231 --> 00:01:47,398
It's all right. Don't get up.

31
00:02:01,204 --> 00:02:03,289
PLEASE TAKE A LOOK WHEN YOU HAVE TIME

32
00:02:03,373 --> 00:02:05,375
PROPOSAL ON FUTURE MANAGEMENT POLICY

33
00:02:11,631 --> 00:02:12,674
Oh!

34
00:02:13,216 --> 00:02:14,425
I'm sorry, Fumi.

35
00:02:15,093 --> 00:02:17,428
Uh, I should have paid closer attention.

36
00:02:19,222 --> 00:02:22,100
Seriously, just lay off and let me drink.
It's just alcohol.

37
00:02:22,183 --> 00:02:23,101
Huh?

38
00:02:25,019 --> 00:02:26,396
How come you won't listen?

39
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,940
I've told you, cirrhosis is irreversible,

40
00:02:29,023 --> 00:02:32,068
which means that your damaged liver
will never go back to normal,

41
00:02:32,152 --> 00:02:34,404
so you can't drink
any alcohol at all, Mom!

42
00:02:34,487 --> 00:02:37,657
- How many times do I have to say it?
- You don't need to say it again.

43
00:02:41,494 --> 00:02:43,413
So now you're "Tanuma?"

44
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:49,878
A senior doctor
at a private practice covered it, huh?

45
00:02:49,961 --> 00:02:51,421
God, you're a liar.

46
00:02:51,504 --> 00:02:53,590
It's still not okay
for you to drink alcohol.

47
00:02:53,673 --> 00:02:57,051
A decent person
would never do plastic surgery at all!

48
00:02:57,135 --> 00:02:59,262
Yeah, well, I didn't want to do it either!

49
00:02:59,345 --> 00:03:01,723
But somehow, I got saddled
with your husband's debt,

50
00:03:01,806 --> 00:03:03,266
so I don't really have a choice!

51
00:03:03,349 --> 00:03:04,475
God, I'm sorry. I really am!

52
00:03:04,559 --> 00:03:05,935
And either way,

53
00:03:06,436 --> 00:03:08,563
you haven't got the right
to a say in my life.

54
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,107
Got it?

55
00:03:11,774 --> 00:03:13,484
You can't do anything at all.

56
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,904
So don't act like you're better than me.

57
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,375
TOHYAMA COSMETIC SURGERY CLINIC
DOCTOR TANUMA

58
00:03:29,459 --> 00:03:33,671
Hi, my subjects. I'm a princess!

59
00:03:33,755 --> 00:03:36,799
My name's Princess Moenon. Princess Pose!

60
00:03:36,883 --> 00:03:39,385
Oh, that's wonderful!

61
00:03:39,469 --> 00:03:41,304
So sweet!

62
00:03:41,387 --> 00:03:43,348
Your eyes
are starting to look like Mommy's.

63
00:03:43,431 --> 00:03:45,225
- You think so?
- Yeah.

64
00:03:45,308 --> 00:03:48,853
Princess Moenon,
Daddy says you look like Mommy.

65
00:03:48,937 --> 00:03:50,438
Mama!

66
00:03:50,521 --> 00:03:52,899
<i>- Mama!</i>
- Oh, good job!

67
00:03:52,982 --> 00:03:54,901
<i>Lovely!</i>

68
00:04:17,257 --> 00:04:18,883
DAUGHTERS

69
00:04:18,967 --> 00:04:21,219
Moeno, should we start shooting?

70
00:04:21,719 --> 00:04:23,805
Mm-hmm. Be right there.

71
00:05:46,554 --> 00:05:48,681
I want you to perform her surgery.

72
00:05:50,058 --> 00:05:51,559
It can't be me. It has to be you.

73
00:05:53,644 --> 00:05:56,522
<i>What? Ms. Backlash</i>
<i>performed Ms. Yuriko's surgery?</i>

74
00:05:56,606 --> 00:05:59,233
Shh! Don't say it too loudly.

75
00:05:59,317 --> 00:06:02,070
But doesn't that mean
Ms. Backlash is really good, then?

76
00:06:02,153 --> 00:06:05,448
I mean, if The Hand of God
trusted her with a surgery…

77
00:06:05,531 --> 00:06:06,532
It was probably a fluke.

78
00:06:06,616 --> 00:06:10,453
No wonder the nursing team
has been buzzing with gossip.

79
00:06:10,536 --> 00:06:11,371
Why's that?

80
00:06:11,454 --> 00:06:16,417
Well, the director's been making Backlash
her assistant for every surgery lately.

81
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:18,961
She's even had her
sit in on counselling sessions.

82
00:06:19,587 --> 00:06:22,965
So, they're saying
that this might be special training

83
00:06:23,049 --> 00:06:25,718
to prepare her
to become the director of a new branch.

84
00:06:25,802 --> 00:06:27,095
Like, in Ginza?

85
00:06:27,595 --> 00:06:29,389
No, that can't be.

86
00:06:30,264 --> 00:06:33,851
Doctor, you're getting all red.
Are you jealous?

87
00:06:33,935 --> 00:06:35,186
No, I'm not.

88
00:06:37,105 --> 00:06:39,816
Don't worry, Mr. Rui.

89
00:06:39,899 --> 00:06:42,068
No matter what anyone says,

90
00:06:42,151 --> 00:06:44,362
you're Director Tohyama's right-hand man.

91
00:06:45,113 --> 00:06:46,572
Just think about

92
00:06:47,073 --> 00:06:49,992
how wild your fans are about you, huh?

93
00:06:51,702 --> 00:06:52,829
I know you are.

94
00:06:53,746 --> 00:06:56,040
I looked over the chairman's proposal,

95
00:06:56,124 --> 00:07:01,129
and, as we expected, it seems that
he's against opening the Ginza branch.

96
00:07:01,629 --> 00:07:02,713
I see that.

97
00:07:02,797 --> 00:07:03,881
Oh, by the way,

98
00:07:04,382 --> 00:07:07,969
have you asked the chairman
about the rumor that he's coming back?

99
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:10,888
- He dodged the question.
- Hm.

100
00:07:12,181 --> 00:07:14,392
But I'll make sure that he doesn't.

101
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:17,603
If he does come back,
I'll lose my position.

102
00:07:20,189 --> 00:07:21,607
ESTABLISHING A CHILDREN'S CLINIC

103
00:07:21,691 --> 00:07:24,235
Excuse me, but are you Moenon?

104
00:07:24,318 --> 00:07:25,486
Uh, yeah.

105
00:07:25,570 --> 00:07:26,821
No way!

106
00:07:26,904 --> 00:07:29,115
I watched the Moenon Channel all the time!

107
00:07:29,198 --> 00:07:32,326
- Everyone our age watched it.
- Oh! Princess Pose!

108
00:07:32,410 --> 00:07:35,246
Are you in elementary school?

109
00:07:35,329 --> 00:07:38,040
Of course she is! It would be weird
if she were still introducing toys!

110
00:07:38,124 --> 00:07:39,459
Yeah, that's true!

111
00:07:39,542 --> 00:07:41,461
- Can we take a picture with you?
- Oh, sure.

112
00:07:41,544 --> 00:07:43,421
This is so exciting!

113
00:07:44,046 --> 00:07:47,133
All right, Princess Pose!

114
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:56,851
MOENON'S PRINCESS COOKING

115
00:07:56,934 --> 00:08:00,605
Our videos haven't been doing well
since we switched to cooking tutorials.

116
00:08:01,606 --> 00:08:04,108
I was thinking we could do a collab
with someone famous.

117
00:08:04,192 --> 00:08:05,693
- Like Ryuji?
- Exactly.

118
00:08:05,776 --> 00:08:07,904
Nah, the target audiences don't match.

119
00:08:12,074 --> 00:08:13,784
- Minami, listen.
- Yeah?

120
00:08:13,868 --> 00:08:15,912
Honestly, the way
things are going right now,

121
00:08:15,995 --> 00:08:18,164
I can't even cover
the mortgage on this place.

122
00:08:18,247 --> 00:08:21,167
Well, why did you buy
something in this high-rise then?

123
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:22,960
Come on. Don't be so harsh.

124
00:08:23,044 --> 00:08:26,005
You know your agency
has benefited from our relationship.

125
00:08:26,088 --> 00:08:29,425
Hey, you know we're grateful
to the Moenon Channel. Of course we are.

126
00:08:29,509 --> 00:08:32,261
We don't have any other channels
with five million subscribers.

127
00:08:32,345 --> 00:08:35,431
- Right?
- Sponsorships were next level.

128
00:08:35,973 --> 00:08:39,685
It's just that kids content
is a tough category.

129
00:08:39,769 --> 00:08:43,481
As soon as they grow up, their character
becomes a bit awkward, right?

130
00:08:44,232 --> 00:08:48,444
You know, it might be good if her persona
went through a drastic change.

131
00:08:57,578 --> 00:08:59,038
- No, no, no.
- That isn't gonna work!

132
00:08:59,121 --> 00:09:01,958
- Why not? It's the…
- Yeah. Exactly.

133
00:09:02,041 --> 00:09:05,503
So tell me,
what's with the cute ribbon, huh?

134
00:09:05,586 --> 00:09:07,255
Welcome home, sis.

135
00:09:07,797 --> 00:09:08,798
Why are you here?

136
00:09:10,424 --> 00:09:13,052
- Oh, hello there.
- Macky quit the loan shark business.

137
00:09:13,135 --> 00:09:15,513
- So he's unemployed.
- Huh?

138
00:09:15,596 --> 00:09:19,308
Oh! It's just that thanks to…
to, uh… to your father's generosity,

139
00:09:19,392 --> 00:09:21,394
I've started working here
as a live-in employee.

140
00:09:21,477 --> 00:09:23,104
- You're living here?
- Yes.

141
00:09:24,021 --> 00:09:26,190
- What?
- It's not what you think, sweetheart.

142
00:09:26,274 --> 00:09:28,776
He had nowhere to go.
He was going to live on the streets.

143
00:09:28,859 --> 00:09:31,320
So I was worried about him, and I offered.

144
00:09:31,404 --> 00:09:34,615
So it's all good. He can sleep in my room.

145
00:09:37,618 --> 00:09:38,452
So sorry.

146
00:09:45,793 --> 00:09:48,045
- Phew! We're safe!
- She's terrifying!

147
00:09:57,305 --> 00:09:58,347
What's up?

148
00:09:58,431 --> 00:10:00,349
Um, it's about Mom.

149
00:10:00,433 --> 00:10:02,810
She hasn't come out of her room
all morning.

150
00:10:02,893 --> 00:10:05,062
She's not a kid. Just leave her alone.

151
00:10:05,938 --> 00:10:08,232
Why does Mom hate plastic surgery so much?

152
00:10:10,693 --> 00:10:12,069
She's old-fashioned.

153
00:10:12,153 --> 00:10:14,030
And close-minded.

154
00:10:14,739 --> 00:10:15,740
What do you think of it?

155
00:10:15,823 --> 00:10:18,117
- Hm?
- Getting work done.

156
00:10:19,869 --> 00:10:23,080
My opinion is, if they wanna do it,
that's on them.

157
00:10:24,874 --> 00:10:26,459
I'm not like Mom, you know?

158
00:10:26,959 --> 00:10:29,211
I'm not gonna interfere
in other people's lives.

159
00:10:30,212 --> 00:10:31,589
- Okay.
- Yeah.

160
00:10:33,841 --> 00:10:34,842
What is it?

161
00:10:36,886 --> 00:10:39,305
Well, I've been thinking
about getting double eyelids.

162
00:10:39,388 --> 00:10:40,681
You better not!

163
00:10:41,599 --> 00:10:44,894
Dumbass! Why would you do that?

164
00:10:45,895 --> 00:10:47,521
You can't.

165
00:10:47,605 --> 00:10:50,191
Seriously, come on!

166
00:10:50,274 --> 00:10:52,151
Why would you do that, Takeru?

167
00:10:52,234 --> 00:10:54,278
- I'd look better with them.
- You look good right now.

168
00:10:54,362 --> 00:10:57,281
<i>Just squeeze it out, like that.</i>

169
00:10:57,365 --> 00:11:00,701
<i>Kinda looks like a snake.</i>
<i>It's gonna be good.</i>

170
00:11:00,785 --> 00:11:03,287
Moenon Beam!

171
00:11:03,371 --> 00:11:05,206
Shine! Voilà!

172
00:11:05,289 --> 00:11:06,791
<i>It's gonna taste…</i>

173
00:11:06,874 --> 00:11:08,417
- Hey, Minami.
- <i>…even better.</i>

174
00:11:08,501 --> 00:11:09,335
Yeah.

175
00:11:11,796 --> 00:11:12,713
What?

176
00:11:13,589 --> 00:11:16,884
Hello, everyone. Right now,
I'm on my way to somewhere exciting.

177
00:11:16,967 --> 00:11:18,928
Can you guess where?

178
00:11:19,011 --> 00:11:21,180
I know it's hard to tell.

179
00:11:21,764 --> 00:11:24,767
All right, we're finally here!

180
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,770
Ta-da!

181
00:11:27,853 --> 00:11:31,357
Today, I'm at the clinic
of Dr. Rin Tohyama,

182
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,733
who's known as "The Hand of God."

183
00:11:32,817 --> 00:11:34,694
I'm so excited!

184
00:11:34,777 --> 00:11:37,863
<i>The plan is for the surgeries</i>
<i>to happen over summer break.</i>

185
00:11:39,073 --> 00:11:42,451
We'd follow her transformation in a series
of videos until school starts back up.

186
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:43,911
MOENON'S BEAUTIFUL PRINCESS PROJECT

187
00:11:43,994 --> 00:11:44,995
That's the idea.

188
00:11:45,079 --> 00:11:47,039
I've told Moeno
that it'll be a full makeover,

189
00:11:47,123 --> 00:11:49,750
so you can have all the freedom
to do whatever you want to.

190
00:11:49,834 --> 00:11:51,919
It's quite risky, though, don't you think?

191
00:11:52,002 --> 00:11:53,796
Didn't a parent get backlash recently

192
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:55,673
for making their daughter
have plastic surgery?

193
00:11:55,756 --> 00:11:58,509
Yeah. But, actually,
some backlash would be good for us--

194
00:11:58,592 --> 00:12:00,720
Sure, it works for you, but not for us.

195
00:12:00,803 --> 00:12:04,807
I'm sure you see that there are tons
of videos of kids doing hair removal

196
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:06,225
and taking all types of surgeries.

197
00:12:06,308 --> 00:12:10,229
If we end up doing this,
we want it to really make an impact.

198
00:12:10,312 --> 00:12:12,857
Look how big it is!

199
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:14,233
Hi, I'm Moeno!

200
00:12:14,316 --> 00:12:16,986
- Thank you so much for having me!
- Hi there.

201
00:12:19,864 --> 00:12:22,158
- Hello there, everyone.
- Hello.

202
00:12:22,241 --> 00:12:24,243
- Hello.
- You two are so pretty.

203
00:12:24,326 --> 00:12:28,956
- Another video shoot?
- Ah, it really takes me back.

204
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:33,169
My daughter used to love watching
the Moenon Channel when she was little.

205
00:12:33,252 --> 00:12:35,713
Huh? That girl is Moeno?

206
00:12:35,796 --> 00:12:38,382
Yeah, it's a pretty bold move
for the director.

207
00:12:38,966 --> 00:12:40,426
Really?

208
00:12:40,509 --> 00:12:44,138
In order to proceed, I need to confirm
how willing the child is,

209
00:12:44,221 --> 00:12:45,556
beyond the patient's consent.

210
00:12:46,223 --> 00:12:48,559
This will put
a huge amount of strain on her body,

211
00:12:48,642 --> 00:12:50,811
so I need to discuss the procedures
with the patient,

212
00:12:50,895 --> 00:12:52,521
to see how far she wants to go with them.

213
00:12:52,605 --> 00:12:55,608
Also, Chairman Tohyama gave me a quote

214
00:12:56,108 --> 00:12:57,693
for the advertising fees.

215
00:12:57,777 --> 00:13:00,404
He said it was roughly this much.

216
00:13:01,405 --> 00:13:02,406
Is that right?

217
00:13:02,490 --> 00:13:03,491
Uh… Huh?

218
00:13:04,074 --> 00:13:07,828
That amount reflects expenses
for advertising the full package deal.

219
00:13:08,621 --> 00:13:10,289
However, after I speak with the patient,

220
00:13:10,372 --> 00:13:12,833
the number of procedures could be reduced,
along with the price.

221
00:13:12,917 --> 00:13:15,211
Right. I see.

222
00:13:15,711 --> 00:13:18,255
Yeah, I think she'll probably
want to go through with all of it.

223
00:13:18,339 --> 00:13:21,133
100 MILLION YEN

224
00:13:23,511 --> 00:13:26,388
Absolutely not.
You can count me out on this one.

225
00:13:26,472 --> 00:13:27,890
I thought you might feel that way.

226
00:13:27,973 --> 00:13:29,767
I do. Now, excuse me.

227
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:31,644
You'll still be
performing the surgery with me.

228
00:13:31,727 --> 00:13:32,937
I told you. I don't want to.

229
00:13:33,020 --> 00:13:34,814
Why are you being so negative?

230
00:13:34,897 --> 00:13:36,899
I don't wanna do that to a child.

231
00:13:36,982 --> 00:13:39,693
There are lots of children out there
who get braces or piercings

232
00:13:39,777 --> 00:13:41,028
or do hair removal.

233
00:13:41,529 --> 00:13:44,824
Age has nothing
to do with wanting to be beautiful.

234
00:13:44,907 --> 00:13:46,784
Yeah, except this kind of surgery is--

235
00:13:46,867 --> 00:13:50,746
I can't believe you're still acting
like plastic surgery is taboo.

236
00:13:50,830 --> 00:13:53,916
I'm going to change
your old-fashioned, rigid way of thinking.

237
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:55,835
It's gonna be good for you.

238
00:14:01,715 --> 00:14:03,050
Excuse me.

239
00:14:04,969 --> 00:14:07,805
Director, Moenon's in the counseling room.

240
00:14:08,305 --> 00:14:10,474
I'll handle the intake counseling.

241
00:14:10,558 --> 00:14:14,144
Dr. Numata, look up some examples
of pediatric plastic surgery.

242
00:14:29,577 --> 00:14:31,912
What's the matter this time?
Sulking again?

243
00:14:31,996 --> 00:14:33,289
Didn't I warn you?

244
00:14:33,372 --> 00:14:35,791
